 "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/sN6Bk2ijkh4/maxresdefault.webp",
 "description": "永世中立国と聞くと、平和で開かれた国を想像するかもしれません。しかし中央アジアのトルクメニスタンは、そのイメージを大きく裏切る国です。今回は、その奇妙な国家体制の正体に迫ります。\n\n主な参考資料\n国連デジタルライブラリ｜Permanent neutrality of Turkmenistan\nhttps://digitallibrary.un.org/record/284240\n\nFreedom House｜Turkmenistan: Freedom in the World 2025\nhttps://freedomhouse.org/country/turkmenistan/freedom-world/2025\n\nGuinness World Records｜Highest density of white marble-clad buildings\nhttps://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/highest-density-of-white-marble-clad-buildings\n\nChatham House｜Turkmenistan: Power, Politics and Petro-Authoritarianism\nhttps://www.chathamhouse.org/sites/default/files/publications/research/2016-03-08-turkmenistan-bohr.pdf\n\nOxford Institute for Energy Studies｜Central Asian Gas: Prospects for the 2020s\nhttps://www.oxfordenergy.org/wpcms/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/Central-Asian-Gas-NG-155.pdf\n\nHuman Rights Watch｜World Report 2025: Turkmenistan\nhttps://www.hrw.org/world-report/2025/country-chapters/turkmenistan\n\nCambridge Core｜A tale of two presidents: personality cult and symbolic nation-building in Turkmenistan\nhttps://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/nationalities-papers/article/tale-of-two-presidents-personality-cult-and-symbolic-nationbuilding-in-turkmenistan/2E3B1CDD0D139B0F8885A666004E9A7B\n\n\n【お知らせ】\nいつも応援ありがとうございます！\nメンバーシップで今後の活動をサポートしていただけると、大きな励みになります。\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWX0rU4o9CR8nUJKz0bSMlQ/join\n\n▼お仕事のお問い合わせ\ngeogra.form@gmail.com\n\n▼使用素材\n■映像素材・画像素材\npixabay\nhttps://pixabay.com/ja/videos/\npexels\nhttps://www.pexels.com/ja-jp/videos/\nACイラスト\nhttps://www.ac-illust.com/\nFreepik\nhttps://jp.freepik.com/\nSILHOUETTE DESIGN\nhttps://kage-design.com/\n\n■音源素材\nartlist\nhttps://artlist.io/\nhttps://pocketse.booth.pm/items/3767621\n効果音ラボ\nhttps://soundeffect-lab.info/\n\n【楽曲提供：株式会社ウナシ】\n\n#ゆっくり解説 #地理 #地政学",
